                                                       Foreground="#A0AEC0" FontSize="11"
                                                       Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                                       ToolTip="System Color Schemes (per-discipline color overrides for HVAC, Piping, Electrical) is a multi-field dialog. Manage per template in Revit's native dialog. The Include checkbox at right still controls whether this aspect is part of the template."/>
