                                                       Foreground="#A0AEC0" FontSize="11"
                                                       Margin="0,0,8,0"
                                                       ToolTip="View Range (Top / Cut Plane / Bottom / View Depth) is a multi-field plan-view setting. The dbHMS View Range Helper tool gives you a visual editor for it; otherwise edit per template in Revit's native View Templates dialog. The Include checkbox at right still controls whether this aspect is part of the template."/>
